# path-regex line-regex: lines that keep the old prefix wdf on purpose, read by rename-prefix.py.
# The rename tooling and its test name the old prefix to find it.
^scripts/(rename-prefix\.(py|allow)|test_rename_prefix\.py)$ .
# The job id namespace is the version 5 UUID of the old domain, kept so job ids do not change.
^contracts/events/README\.md$ version 5 UUID of `wdf\.dev`
# A built wheel keeps the names its metadata was built with.
^deploy/mirror/wheelhouse/ .
# A hash can spell anything.
^docs/animations/package-lock\.json$ "integrity":
